; The billboard icon Godot's 3D editor draws at the origin of a node, for the one variable no other
; golden moves. A scene that sets `gizmos: true` shows it (ADR-0056); every other golden keeps the
; Gizmos toggle off, so none of them draws an icon. The row holds two tinted lights, a camera, both
; particle emitters and an audio player, so the golden shows the tint and the dimmed unselected look.
; The `select:` golden selects the spot light, whose icon returns to full colour.
